  "_about": [
    "Every picture on the site that is not a year-gallery photo and not a game screenshot, dated, so tools/photos.py ingest can put it in the year gallery it belongs to. Game screenshots need no row here: ingest reads their dates straight out of fan-shots.js.",
    "path: under /assets/img/. date: ISO, as precise as is known ('2023', '2023-12', '2023-04-29 19:30'); a leading '<' is an upper bound, shown as 'before ...'. group: only where the date alone cannot place it (a bare year, or no date at all, which shows as 'Date unrecorded'). why: where the date comes from.",
    "Left out on purpose: the app and bot icons, the Discord server icon, the circle avatars and the me/ portraits (crops of gallery photos), the five WWDC photos (already in Senior), and art that is not mine (the anniversary posters and logos, the Minshawi portraits, the Stranger Things wallpaper)."
